<title>SWEDEN: Swedish bond auction taken by one player.</title>
<headline>Swedish bond auction taken by one player.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of 2.00 billion crowns of nine-year bonds was 6.76 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p> Volume issued (billions)		    2.0</p>
<p> Total bids    (billions)		    4.13</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		     1</p>
<p> Number of bids				 45</p>
<p> Lowest yield				    6.76</p>
<p> Highest yield				   6.76</p>
<p> Weighted average yield			6.76</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
